# The pre-commit lint-staged hook only sees commits made from a local checkout.
# Commits authored from Codespaces, the web editor, or an agent PR flow bypass
# it entirely, which is how 45 files drifted out of Prettier's format and five
# tsc errors reached main. Re-run the three fast static gates on the way out so
# nothing unformatted or untyped can be pushed.
#
# Skip for a one-off with: git push --no-verify
npm run lint && npm run format:check && npm run typecheck
